Space Layer
    ☐ Plan core features
        Endless explorable universe
            Hazardous parts of space
                One way trips only (maybe using drones)
                Certain spaces must be terraformed on galactic level to make them accessible
            Discovery system & rewards
                Discoveries are used by civilizations

        Starships
            Fleet management & fleet warfare
            Gigantic megaships

        Mega rare interstellar threats
            Natural galactic events can cause disasters
            Alien threats
                Giga sized aliens

        Player can participate in universe & establish an independent civilization

        Story mode
            Impending disaster which drives exploration and warfare in story mode

        Galactic news network
            Reports various events around universe
                Reports about human losses in disasters and conflicts
            Press ships fly around reporting 

        Autonomous civilizations
            Epand and battle each other
            React to player actions

        Universe system
            Player can play in universe with different characters and share with other characters

        On-foot gameplay
            Player can exit ships and traverse on foot on stations, planets etc.
            On foot gameplay can offer lucrative benefits
                Meet other characters face to face to gain charisma bonus
                Assasinate important characters to influence politics and be rewarded

        Terraforming & on ground installations

        Background simulation
            Universe can be run as a background process without window
            Updates can be feeded to terminal session and over internet 


